@api = http://localhost:3000

### Catalogue
GET {{api}}/catalog

### 1. Souscrire
POST {{api}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyId": "cmp_001", "plan": "starter", "billingPeriod": "monthly" }

### 5. Consulter (remplacer l'id par celui reçu)
GET {{api}}/subscriptions/sub_XXXXXXXX

### 6. Lister les abonnements d'une entreprise
GET {{api}}/companies/cmp_001/subscriptions

### 2. Changer de formule
PATCH {{api}}/subscriptions/sub_XXXXXXXX
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plan": "pro" }

### 2. Passer à l'annuel
PATCH {{api}}/subscriptions/sub_XXXXXXXX
Content-Type: application/json

{ "billingPeriod": "annual" }

### 3. Résilier
POST {{api}}/subscriptions/sub_XXXXXXXX/cancel

### 4. Changer un prix (nouveaux clients uniquement)
PUT {{api}}/catalog/pro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthly": 59 }
